{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51307","headline":"太姥山 · 薛令之","name":"太姥山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扬舲穷海岛，选胜访神仙。\n鬼斧巧开凿，仙踪常往还。\n东瓯冥漠外，南越渺茫间。\n爲问容成子，刀圭乞驻颜。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》一一○八《福宁州部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛令之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}